{
  "name": "Automated US EPA ECHO Environmental Compliance & ESG Penalty Auditor — Daily B2B Data & Compliance Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated US EPA ECHO Environmental Compliance & ESG Penalty Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nAudits industrial facilities across the United States via the official U.S. EPA ECHO REST API. Extracts Clean Air/Water/RCRA non-compliance quarters, Significant Non-Complier (SNC) flags, and federal penalties to calculate ESG liability scores (0-100).\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/us-epa-echo-environmental-compliance-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-epa-echo-environmental-compliance-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: us-epa-echo-environmental-compliance-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "546b7858-cb10-5995-a1ea-f5824507ab03",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1de0942e-8417-5c9c-bc36-70dfddd85e20",
      "name": "Daily 07:00 AM Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~us-epa-echo-environmental-compliance-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"queries\": [\n    {\n      \"facility_name\": \"ExxonMobil\",\n      \"state\": \"TX\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"facility_name\": \"Chevron\",\n      \"state\": \"CA\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"max_results_per_query\": 5\n}",
